  "id": "bonnet-syndrome",
  "term": "Bonnet syndrome",
  "definition": "Bonnet syndrome, or Charles Bonnet syndrome, is a condition in which people with visual impairment experience visual hallucinations. It can be distressing, may increase health-related anxiety, and is often missed because awareness of it is limited.",
